OL,3,AReform's #72m donations 'entirely in
OL,4,Aline with law', Jenrick says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These two donations are entirely in
OL,7,Fline with the law as it is and, as far
OL,8,Fas we know, the law as it's going to be
OL,9,Fin the future," Jenrick said.
